# Read at BUILD time only, to fetch published blog posts from the Inkwell
# studio's Supabase project (scripts/blogContent.ts). Neither value reaches the
# browser bundle: the build writes static JSON under public/blog instead.
#
# The anon key is a public, RLS-protected key — `published_entries` is the only
# table it can read.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
